{"1550000": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "TRYPAN", "steam_appid": 1550000, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Stagmon has been a ghost town for years.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Everyone's gone.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>I have to know.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Please don't come looking for me.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Love you,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>David&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TRYPAN</strong> is an exploration-based survival horror FPS that follows your journey into madness. Explore a city consumed by a mysterious evil in an attempt to find answers about your missing father. Scavenge, improvise, and wield various firearms to face off against reshaped monsters as you uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1550000/extras/064e9d91f0c599e3672deb380d9b1d3c.poster.avif?t=1787783966\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1550000/extras/064e9d91f0c599e3672deb380d9b1d3c.webm?t=1787783966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1550000/extras/064e9d91f0c599e3672deb380d9b1d3c.mp4?t=1787783966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-crafted world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of different items to find and use.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional explorable paths and rewards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1550000/extras/808a1d4f6810c1db6923c0c40bdc5676.poster.avif?t=1787783966\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1550000/extras/808a1d4f6810c1db6923c0c40bdc5676.webm?t=1787783966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1550000/extras/808a1d4f6810c1db6923c0c40bdc5676.mp4?t=1787783966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive 3D grid-based inventory system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft weapons and supplies from scavenged materials. Find recipes in the world and use various materials to create deadly and helpful tools.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep item mechanics. Refill magazines with ammo, unbox items, and always stay prepared.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1550000/extras/ac14d42825b96d6e293d3ee350d2176c.poster.avif?t=1787783966\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1550000/extras/ac14d42825b96d6e293d3ee350d2176c.webm?t=1787783966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1550000/extras/ac14d42825b96d6e293d3ee350d2176c.mp4?t=1787783966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physically reactive enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight a diverse cast of enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smart monsters use different attacks to take you down.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Stagmon has been a ghost town for years.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\